{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stoneguard is an immersive strategy game set in a grim medieval apocalypse, where you must defend the magical Lifestone.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/84a6c489aefae4ca39ea789e9b2448a8.webp?t=1772232360\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect the Lifestone</strong><br><br>You start with nothing but the will to survive in an apocalyptic world. You protect humanity's only source of magic, the lifestone, from falling into the wrong hands. To defend the last glimpse of hope: Craft walls, build towers and fortify.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/7dadacfe4b22766f83668eeb77079f2a.poster.avif?t=1772232360\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/7dadacfe4b22766f83668eeb77079f2a.webm?t=1772232360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/7dadacfe4b22766f83668eeb77079f2a.mp4?t=1772232360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/84a6c489aefae4ca39ea789e9b2448a8.webp?t=1772232360\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience Traumatic Injuries &amp; Gruesome Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accurate weapon tracing detects which body part has been hit. You must be tactful in combat to protect your vital limbs and choose which parts of your enemies to sever. Every lost limb carries severe consequences, hindering your performance in both battle and daily survival. But as long as the Lifestone is protected, there are ways to heal your battle wounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/35d732eea3f1ede9af5a992bfa42f15a.poster.avif?t=1772232360\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/35d732eea3f1ede9af5a992bfa42f15a.webm?t=1772232360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/35d732eea3f1ede9af5a992bfa42f15a.mp4?t=1772232360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/84a6c489aefae4ca39ea789e9b2448a8.webp?t=1772232360\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft with the Remains of Monsters</strong><br><br>Strategize your defenses before nightfall, then command and fight alongside your survivors in battle. Issue orders amid the chaos as you face five distinct boss encounters, each summoning new hordes of enemies. Craft and research powerful weapons forged from the limbs of your fallen enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/3796677cf898a699d987b15abf410a44.poster.avif?t=1772232360\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/3796677cf898a699d987b15abf410a44.webm?t=1772232360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/3796677cf898a699d987b15abf410a44.mp4?t=1772232360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/84a6c489aefae4ca39ea789e9b2448a8.webp?t=1772232360\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basebuilding and Resource Management</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt and gather resources from the world around you, recruit survivors to join your settlement, and work together to gather, craft, and build. Expand your community with housing, farms, workshops, and more as you create a thriving community amid the apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/617f2b00141d38524d256589996fd345.poster.avif?t=1772232360\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/617f2b00141d38524d256589996fd345.webm?t=1772232360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/617f2b00141d38524d256589996fd345.mp4?t=1772232360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/84a6c489aefae4ca39ea789e9b2448a8.webp?t=1772232360\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Unique and Immersive Strategy Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a strategy game from a third person point of view, with a dynamic day and night cycle which aligns with the three phases of gameplay; day time, preparation phase, and night time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/f9da2571868e8443a5330d2766e157cb.poster.avif?t=1772232360\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/f9da2571868e8443a5330d2766e157cb.webm?t=1772232360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/f9da2571868e8443a5330d2766e157cb.mp4?t=1772232360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2704450?t=1772232360","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/487144d48cac28d131c343127328ddc95bba5ad1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772232360","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/58d5806b6f87e8b2d52c9328744cd8cd5a0d05e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772232360","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/58d5806b6f87e8b2d52c9328744cd8cd5a0d05e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772232360","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game is not appropriate for all ages and may not be appropriate for viewing at work.\r\nStoneguard contains intense violence, blood and gore, horror themes, depictions of dead, dismembered and decapitated human and non-human bodies. General mature content\r\n"},"demos":[{"appid":2934410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stoneguard is an immersive strategy game set in a grim medieval apocalypse, where you must defend the magical Lifestone.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/84a6c489aefae4ca39ea789e9b2448a8.webp?t=1772232360\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect the Lifestone</strong><br><br>You start with nothing but the will to survive in an apocalyptic world. You protect humanity's only source of magic, the lifestone, from falling into the wrong hands. To defend the last glimpse of hope: Craft walls, build towers and fortify.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/7dadacfe4b22766f83668eeb77079f2a.poster.avif?t=1772232360\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/7dadacfe4b22766f83668eeb77079f2a.webm?t=1772232360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/7dadacfe4b22766f83668eeb77079f2a.mp4?t=1772232360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/84a6c489aefae4ca39ea789e9b2448a8.webp?t=1772232360\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience Traumatic Injuries &amp; Gruesome Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accurate weapon tracing detects which body part has been hit. You must be tactful in combat to protect your vital limbs and choose which parts of your enemies to sever. Every lost limb carries severe consequences, hindering your performance in both battle and daily survival. But as long as the Lifestone is protected, there are ways to heal your battle wounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/35d732eea3f1ede9af5a992bfa42f15a.poster.avif?t=1772232360\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/35d732eea3f1ede9af5a992bfa42f15a.webm?t=1772232360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/35d732eea3f1ede9af5a992bfa42f15a.mp4?t=1772232360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704450/extras/84a6c489aefae4ca39ea789e9b2448a8.webp?t=1772232360\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft with the Remains of Monsters</strong><br><br>Strategize your defenses before nightfall, then command and fight alongside your survivors in battle. Issue orders amid the chaos as you face five distinct boss encounters, each summoning new hordes of enemies. Craft and research powerful weapons forged from the limbs of your fallen enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared